`,n(e.p,{children:["One of the main reasons Valibot feels easy to use is that its mental model is very clear. The API is reduced to ",n(e.strong,{children:"schemas"}),", ",n(e.strong,{children:"methods"}),", and ",n(e.strong,{children:"actions"}),"."]}),`
